    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udce2  Wishlist and demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is in development, please help support us by <strong>adding us to your</strong> <strong><i>wishlist</i></strong> \ud83d\udea8<br>and by <strong>enjoying our early look</strong> <strong><i>demo</i></strong>! (2 - 8 players)\ud83c\udf89 </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real-time artillery party game that\u2019s chaotic and fun. Featuring fluid movement, punchy weapons, and fully destructible terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple, Satisfying Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We obsessed over making the controls simple, intuitive, satisfying, with depth and just plain fun. Easy to pick up, whether you're new to games or seasoned, you can still compete and have a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/2f55149dc3322b233f02e12a7951382b.poster.avif?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/2f55149dc3322b233f02e12a7951382b.webm?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/2f55149dc3322b233f02e12a7951382b.mp4?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Couch Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by our memories crowding around the computer with friends. We want to bring people together, so gather your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/91dce561d803422b54462eff2e5169e9.poster.avif?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/91dce561d803422b54462eff2e5169e9.webm?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/91dce561d803422b54462eff2e5169e9.mp4?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endlessly Replayable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible terrain and dynamic water adds layers of depth and surprise. Enabling use of really clever tactics to outmaneuver opponents, like drilling through your friend's cover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, we also made a fancy deck-builder system that introduces cool new weapons, upgrades, and endless possibilities, ensuring no two matches are ever the same.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/e67dc0b12d51490630b008d6843d358e.poster.avif?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/e67dc0b12d51490630b008d6843d358e.webm?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/e67dc0b12d51490630b008d6843d358e.mp4?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/b7c198ffb98ffa66ccbdbe5857ec1413.webp?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real-time artillery party game that\u2019s chaotic and fun. Featuring fluid movement, punchy weapons, and fully destructible terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple, Satisfying Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We obsessed over making the controls simple, intuitive, satisfying, with depth and just plain fun. Easy to pick up, whether you're new to games or seasoned, you can still compete and have a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/2f55149dc3322b233f02e12a7951382b.poster.avif?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/2f55149dc3322b233f02e12a7951382b.webm?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/2f55149dc3322b233f02e12a7951382b.mp4?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Couch Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by our memories crowding around the computer with friends. We want to bring people together, so gather your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/91dce561d803422b54462eff2e5169e9.poster.avif?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/91dce561d803422b54462eff2e5169e9.webm?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/91dce561d803422b54462eff2e5169e9.mp4?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endlessly Replayable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible terrain and dynamic water adds layers of depth and surprise. Enabling use of really clever tactics to outmaneuver opponents, like drilling through your friend's cover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, we also made a fancy deck-builder system that introduces cool new weapons, upgrades, and endless possibilities, ensuring no two matches are ever the same.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/e67dc0b12d51490630b008d6843d358e.poster.avif?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/e67dc0b12d51490630b008d6843d358e.webm?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/e67dc0b12d51490630b008d6843d358e.mp4?t=1749180392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444110/extras/b7c198ffb98ffa66ccbdbe5857ec1413.webp?t=1749180392\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2>",
    "short_description": "Cow Chess is a real-time artillery party game \u2014 think Super Smash Bros meets Worms. It features fluid, wall-sticking movement, punchy weapons, and fully destructible terrain. As the game progresses, you unlock upgrades that transform your abilities, pushing you to adjust your strategies on the fly.",
